{"4458210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sushi Day", "steam_appid": 4458210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458210/extras/a25586a6080cc01c4db6b1ee82f0ba3d.poster.avif?t=1772753253\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458210/extras/a25586a6080cc01c4db6b1ee82f0ba3d.webm?t=1772753253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458210/extras/a25586a6080cc01c4db6b1ee82f0ba3d.mp4?t=1772753253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Welcome to <strong>Sushi Day</strong>, a cozy restaurant management simulation where adorable animal customers visit your growing food shop every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft sushi combinations, prepare pasta dishes, and serve birds, cats, rabbits, foxes, and turtles in a relaxing yet fast-paced time-management gameplay loop. Balance speed, precision, and strategy during busy shifts, then optimize your restaurant at the end of each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍣 <strong>Cook &amp; Craft Delicious Dishes</strong><br>Master sushi recipes, experiment with pasta varieties, and prepare for future menu expansions like Boba Tea. Each dish requires timing and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458210/extras/79d0c8553301b9d7704fa9d9c8c959bc.poster.avif?t=1772753253\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458210/extras/79d0c8553301b9d7704fa9d9c8c959bc.webm?t=1772753253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458210/extras/79d0c8553301b9d7704fa9d9c8c959bc.mp4?t=1772753253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ <strong>VIP Guests &amp; Star Rating System</strong><br>Special VIP customers visit your restaurant. Serve them perfectly to earn bonus tips. The higher your star rating, the greater the chance rare VIP guests appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📅 <strong>Daily Restaurant Management Loop</strong><br>Survive the rush hours, then manage your earnings, upgrade equipment, unlock new recipes, and refine your strategy at the end of each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458210/extras/29b3aaf17a9eab0787c29e78886cb7b9.poster.avif?t=1772753253\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458210/extras/29b3aaf17a9eab0787c29e78886cb7b9.webm?t=1772753253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4458210/extras/29b3aaf17a9eab0787c29e78886cb7b9.mp4?t=1772753253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Animal Customers with Personality</strong><br>Serve a charming cast of animal guests, each bringing life and variety to your cozy restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏪 <strong>Expand &amp; Customize (Upcoming Features)</strong><br>Future updates will introduce decorations and customization options to create your own unique dining atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re looking for a relaxing cooking simulation or a satisfying time-management challenge, Sushi Day delivers a wholesome and rewarding restaurant experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=